#: ../../map.rst:133
#: f15dacb856d7463c8f02949d8153807e
msgid "When these distinctions are allowed to blur, the different kinds of documentation bleed into each other. Writing style and content make their way into inappropriate places. It also causes structural problems, which make it even more difficult to maintain the discipline of appropriate writing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:-1
#: ed9ff38728564b9387e0ec9c8859730b
msgid "Total collapse of the structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:139
#: db1a79f7dbd642a985a4b58b956ee293
msgid "In the worst case there is a complete or partial collapse of tutorials and how-to guides into each other, making it impossible to meet the needs served by either."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:145
#: 5630feccfb504fdc8e7aa6706abedc3f
msgid "The journey around the map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:147
#: 8ce9984c83274ae9a2caa15b0d056f92
msgid "Diátaxis is intended to help documentation better serve users in their *cycle of interaction* with a product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:149
#: 5eabe9d1c00a4f13b1c02b9bbd3f2b98
msgid "This phrase should not be understood too literally. It is not the case that a user must encounter the different kinds of documentation in the order *tutorials* > *how-to guides* > *technical reference* > *explanation*. In practice, an actual user may enter the documentation anywhere in search of guidance on some particular subject, and what they want to read will change from moment to moment as they use your documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:154
#: 35a1ef9f98e043d894d1d1a572de048d
msgid "However, the idea of a cycle of documentation needs, that proceeds through different phases, is sound and corresponds to the way that people actually do become expert in a craft. There is a sense and meaning to this ordering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:-1
#: 00f28faed64f4f549eaf3e20b32fd7f4
msgid "Moving around the map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:162
#: 7ff6ee577e144e3fa15fbab4c3bf1a5d
msgid "*learning-oriented phase*: We begin by learning, and learning a skill means diving straight in to do it - under the guidance of a teacher, if we're lucky."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:164
#: 8c6632cd635e430c8173b3553cb63d56
msgid "*goal-oriented phase*: Next we want to put the skill to work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:165
#: a2c10e39e84c4166b8c933fc371efaba
msgid "*information-oriented phase*: As soon as our work calls upon knowledge that we don't already have in our head, it requires us to consult technical reference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:167
#: 18b3015395bc4c0485d232157a16fe3f
msgid "*explanation-oriented phase*: Finally, away from the work, we reflect on our practice and knowledge to understand the whole."
msgstr ""

#: ../../map.rst:170
#: c7b7fcdd1ade42b9870c2f54f64e9146
msgid "And then it's back to the beginning, perhaps for a new thing to grasp, or to penetrate deeper."
msgstr ""
